So I can be faithful, and I can go do it, right?

917
00:55:44,700 --> 00:55:49,920
So we want to hear this, but we want to break it down practical for ourselves, so we're not getting distracted.

918
00:55:49,920 --> 00:55:51,180
But anyway, let me just pray for you guys.

919
00:55:51,180 --> 00:55:53,200
And then, Brian, if you would come back up.

920
00:55:53,200 --> 00:55:57,480
Well, Lord, we just thank you for your word this morning.

921
00:55:57,480 --> 00:56:01,400
Lord, we thank you, Lord God, for the work that you're doing through this church,

922
00:56:01,400 --> 00:56:06,860
the blessing that this church is to this community, and will continue to be through this community, Lord God.

923
00:56:07,060 --> 00:56:13,440
I just pray for each of us today that we would receive your words this morning with a humble and teachable heart.

924
00:56:13,440 --> 00:56:21,160
Lord God, you know how to instruct us in a way that convicts us without tearing us down, Lord God.

925
00:56:21,160 --> 00:56:25,740
You know how to speak to us in a way that motivates us and gives us clarity.

926
00:56:25,900 --> 00:56:29,480
And so I just ask you to do it this morning, Lord, for each of us, Lord God.

927
00:56:29,480 --> 00:56:35,500
Would you begin to put faces in our minds, people that you have placed within arm's reach, Lord God.

928
00:56:35,500 --> 00:56:40,360
People that we need to set free, that we need to, maybe people we need to stop oppressing,

929
00:56:40,360 --> 00:56:42,320
and we're just now realizing we've been doing it.

930
00:56:42,320 --> 00:56:47,880
Lord God, would your grace and forgiveness just heal our hearts as our own sin is revealed to us, Lord God.

931
00:56:48,680 --> 00:56:51,620
Lord God, give us your mercy this morning, but also give us your love for people.

932
00:56:51,620 --> 00:56:54,160
And so I just thank you for all these things, Lord God.

933
00:56:54,160 --> 00:56:56,820
I thank you for the people in this room today.

934
00:56:56,820 --> 00:57:03,540
And Lord God, may you just continue to lead us and guide us as we love one another

935
00:57:03,540 --> 00:57:06,260
in the ways that you've laid out for us.

936
00:57:06,260 --> 00:57:07,320
In your name, amen.

937
